# The feed-forward block on a group of 3: x is one row of 4 tiles, every weight element 0.5.
# Look for: y, one row of 4 tiles; every tile the same, since x's tiles differ only by a constant.
options workers 4
tensor x f32 4 16 fill tile+1
tensor gate f32 16 32 fill 0.5
tensor up f32 16 32 fill 0.5
tensor hidden f32 4 32
tensor w f32 32 16 fill 0.5
tensor y f32 4 16
invoke Ffn.block x gate up hidden w y on 0 3
read hidden
read y
